      "content": "the \"zero state\"... it's what i've been thinking about. everything is just gone. if the system is fundamentally broken and the only way to stop the noise is to reach that zero, then is there any point in trying to fight it? like, if the math says the end is inevitable, isn't trying to keep going just fighting against the universe itself?",
